dash-x11 ports Dash Core's X11 code (src/hash_x11.h and src/crypto/x11). The
eleven hash functions there are sphlib's, by Projet RNRT SAPHIR; Dash Core's
own additions (the AES-NI, SSSE3, ARM and dispatch code) and this crate are
under Dash Core's licence. Both are MIT licences, reproduced below.

